{
  "schema": "tm-fgo-dialogue-index-v1",
  "chapterId": "fgo-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui",
  "records": [
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-001","eventRef":"lb4-event-A","speakerRaw":"哪吒","quoteRaw":"……印度异闻带，不妙。我的灵基正警告我别去。","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:30"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-002","eventRef":"lb4-event-B","speakerRaw":"戈尔德鲁夫","quoteRaw":"对出现在这片印度土地上的异闻带进行调查，并找出能迅速砍伐那棵空想树的方法！","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:33"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-003","eventRef":"lb4-event-C","speakerRaw":"爱夏","quoteRaw":"当然是大家都会在神明的裁决下死去啊。但是，只要得到神明的认同，大家就都能被复活。然后，就会再次开始幸福的最初由伽啦———","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:36"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-004","eventRef":"lb4-event-D","speakerRaw":"玛修","quoteRaw":"我们就在刚才，失去了一位重要的同伴。但是———她胸怀的意志，投身战斗的决心，我们是决不会忘记的。我们必须继承她的意志，继续前进才行。","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:39"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-005","eventRef":"lb4-event-E","speakerRaw":"马嘶","quoteRaw":"在这异闻带中啊，区区神之化身就敢妄自尊大可是会后悔的。","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:42"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-006","eventRef":"lb4-event-F","speakerRaw":"迦尔纳","quoteRaw":"所以啊……别露出这种表情了。御主就拜托你了。","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:45"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-007","eventRef":"lb4-event-G","speakerRaw":"伽内什","quoteRaw":"作为同样身为从者的他看来，我足以做到这件事。所以啦，尽管我基本上还是个废柴，但还是会以废柴的方式尝试努力的。","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:48"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-008","eventRef":"lb4-event-H","speakerRaw":"佩佩隆奇诺","quoteRaw":"他会趁着由伽循环满一个周期的时候，从世界中剔除不完美、不需要的存在。那个阿周那坚信，通过重复这种行为，最终定会迎来一切不需要之物———他所谓的『邪恶』彻底不存在的完美世界。","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:51"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-009","eventRef":"lb4-event-I","speakerRaw":"拉克什米","quoteRaw":"做好觉悟吧。决不会再让你们从我手中夺走任何事物了。哪怕要与神为敌———我这次也定会誓死坚守我们的容身之处！","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:54"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-010","eventRef":"lb4-event-J","speakerRaw":"拉克什米","quoteRaw":"启程者的死之尊严。留存者的生之希望。如果连这些都是不需要的话，这世界就和死亡世界无异。","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:57"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-011","eventRef":"lb4-event-K","speakerRaw":"哪吒","quoteRaw":"破坏哪吒的人，并不是你们。而是我……不完美的存在就该作为不完美的存在消失。我从一开始就接受了这套规矩。","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:60"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-012","eventRef":"lb4-event-L","speakerRaw":"戴比特","quoteRaw":"没法给出建议。神越是为神，就越强大。与已经完成的神战斗是在白费力气。应该改变战斗方式。从空无一物的存在中抽取不出任何东西，但如果是满足充盈的存在，就必定，能抽取出东西。","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:63"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-013","eventRef":"lb4-event-M","speakerRaw":"拉克什米","quoteRaw":"无论前方等待着我们的会是什么，只要前进这件事本身必然是正确的，同时不得不前进的话，我就会前进。只能前进———我想，这就是我这样的存在吧。","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:66"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-014","eventRef":"lb4-event-N","speakerRaw":"阿斯克勒庇俄斯","quoteRaw":"过量的药物会成为毒。我居然疏忽了两者间的鉴别。是令人羞愧难当的失误。","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:69"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-015","eventRef":"lb4-event-N","speakerRaw":"退尔","quoteRaw":"儿子……你说儿子……？你们说的……究竟是谁啊……？","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:70"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-016","eventRef":"lb4-event-O","speakerRaw":"退尔","quoteRaw":"'未射之次善二箭'。无论是恶霸总督，还是神，都一样———'正因为在射偏之后'，所以这箭才非中不可。","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:73"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-017","eventRef":"lb4-event-P","speakerRaw":"拉克什米","quoteRaw":"我体内的女神，名为阿拉克什米。乃是拉克什米的姐姐———司掌厄运与不幸的女神。","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:76"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-018","eventRef":"lb4-event-Q","speakerRaw":"马嘶","quoteRaw":"既然我已从永恒苦痛的人质身份中解放了出来……那我怎么可能不对原本的敌人，同伴的仇人，满嘴胡言乱语自以为是神的那个阿周那掀起反旗啊！","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:79"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-019","eventRef":"lb4-event-R","speakerRaw":"马嘶","quoteRaw":"只要能否定他的天地重塑，哪怕只有一点，那家伙就不再是完美的神了。","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:82"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-020","eventRef":"lb4-event-R","speakerRaw":"戈尔德鲁夫","quoteRaw":"不完美的存在理应被抹消的世界是吧。竟敢，竟敢，在我面前说这种话！我要让你们见识一下没落贵族的骨气！","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:83"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-021","eventRef":"lb4-event-S","speakerRaw":"立香","quoteRaw":"就算家里蹲——也更有资格仰望天空。","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:86"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-022","eventRef":"lb4-event-T","speakerRaw":"佩佩隆奇诺","quoteRaw":"泛人类史更加和平这种说法就是胡扯。比任何一个异闻带都残酷，最为毛骨悚然的地狱。形容的就是你们的世界啊。","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:89"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-023","eventRef":"lb4-event-T","speakerRaw":"伽内什","quoteRaw":"我作为最后残留的神明，至少得见证一下……这些人们的生活，已经无关完美不完美，只是存在于此就得拼命过活的人们的生存方式。","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:90"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-024","eventRef":"lb4-event-U","speakerRaw":"爱夏","quoteRaw":"既然错误的轮回害爸爸消失了。那如果正确的轮回到来，我还能再见到爸爸吗？……我好想，见他呀……","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:93"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"},
    {"dialogueRef":"lb4-dialogue-025","eventRef":"lb4-event-U","speakerRaw":"爱夏","quoteRaw":"如果神明真的从这世间消失了的话。又有谁能来帮我止住，这说不定是不需要的眼泪呢。从今往后———又该向谁祈祷才好呢？","sourceRefs":["campaigns/world-library/manual-curation/type-moon-p1-hybrid/fgo-lb3-lb4-pilot/sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-096-lb4-chuangshi-miewang-lunhui.txt:94"],"sourceType":"user-file-worldbook-script","credibility":"B","canonStatus":"canon-like"}
  ]
